---
import PostIt from '@/components/PostIt.astro';
---

<PostIt background="#22b" color="#ccc">
  To finalize it, we create a linear gradient and an animation using <span class="term">stroke-dasharray</span> and <span class="term">stroke-dashoffset</span>, to make it look like a loading animation
</PostIt>

<style>
  /* The note's blue is fixed, so the accent is lifted toward white until it reads on it in every theme. */
  .term {
    color: color-mix(in oklch, var(--theme-accent), white 60%);
  }
</style>
